WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.246 --> 00:00:07.281
"The Side Effects of Human Growth Hormone
as an Anti-Aging Therapy"

00:00:07.337 --> 00:00:10.341
Of all the anti-aging
clinic scams,

00:00:10.341 --> 00:00:13.380
the selling and administration
of human growth hormone

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.200
has been called
"perhaps the most blatant

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.780
and organized form
of quackery today."

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.840
It all started,
promisingly enough,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.760
with a small trial published

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.140
in the New England
Journal of Medicine

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.480
in which 12 men
over the age of 60

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.000
who got injections
of growth hormone

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.840
gained eight pounds of lean mass
over a period of six months,

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.660
compared to nine guys
who weren't injected.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:40.020
Newspapers around the world
heralded the results,

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.420
anti-aging clinics popped up

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.240
to offer the injections

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:48.240
for $4,700 per month or more,

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.520
and the popular press
churned out books

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.280
extolling the hormone's
age reversing properties.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.640
After all, that's how much
muscle mass one might lose

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.920
over 10 to 20 years of aging.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.020
That's assuming, though,

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.600
that what they gained
was muscle.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.660
The original study
didn't measure

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.100
muscle strength or performance,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.320
but larger, longer, and better,

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.600
i.e. placebo-controlled studies,

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.420
subsequently did,
and found zero benefit.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:19.380
A meta-analysis of studies
of growth hormone

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:21.300
for athletic performance
found that

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:24.420
it may even worsen
exercise capacity.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:28.440
Wait, how can you gain
pounds of lean mass,

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.480
but not get any stronger?

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:34.140
By retaining pounds of water.

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.400
The lean mass was mostly
just due to fluid retention.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.460
In fact, obvious swelling,
soft tissue edema,

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:44.580
is one of the most common
side effects of growth hormone,

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.280
affecting about
half of recipients.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.280
Other side effects include
joint aches,

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.780
carpal tunnel syndrome,

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:53.520
male breast development,

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:55.140
elevated blood sugars,

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.420
and new-onset diabetes.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:02.220
All this with no evidence
of anti-aging effects.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.860
If anything,
growth hormone may actually

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.440
accelerate the aging process.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:10.140
For example,
those with acromegaly,

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:12.060
a disease
of excess growth hormone,

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:15.420
suffer disproportionately
from muscle weakness,

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:18.840
as well as diabetes,
high blood pressure,

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.580
artery dysfunction,

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.440
and bone loss.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.280
In the 1980s,
doctors and parents

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:29.760
conspired to inject short kids
with growth hormone

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.560
to try to make them grow taller.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.600
What happened to them?

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.820
A study following
thousands of children

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.400
who were injected decades ago
with growth hormone,

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.540
for one reason or another,

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:43.320
found they had
a 33 percent increased risk

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.300
of being dead,

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:49.200
largely from brain bleeds
and tumors.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:53.100
The strokes would make sense
from blood pressure elevation,

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.780
and the malignancies

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:57.120
from the growth hormone-
induced rise

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.940
of the cancer-promoting
growth hormone IGF-1.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.720
20,000 to 30,000 people
in the U.S.

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.520
are estimated
to use growth hormone

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.100
in a vain attempt
to combat aging,

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:11.640
a practice referred to in
a leading endocrinology journal

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:15.480
as a "medical fraud
of unprecedented proportions."

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:19.080
Given the adverse effects,
maybe it's good

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:22.260
that all the tested samples
of human growth hormone,

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.180
also known as somatotropin,

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.060
sourced from online pharmacies
were found to have

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.160
a fraction
of the labelled amount,

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:32.580
presumably due to degradation
from improper storage,

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:36.060
and the majority of samples
confiscated in another study

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:39.420
were counterfeit
and contained none at all.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.900
There's also
a proliferation of pills

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.960
and nasal
or sublingual spray forms

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:48.540
that makes no biological sense,

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.820
as the hormone
is too large a protein

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.700
to effectively cross membranes,
and if swallowed,

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.560
is simply destroyed
in the stomach.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.140
Given the risk of cancer

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:00.360
and potential
for a shortened lifespan,

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:03.720
one prominent clinician remarked
that maybe growth hormone

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.420
is a "true anti-aging drug"

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:09.300
in that it may
prematurely stop you

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.860
from growing any older.

